### User Management API Tests

### Register a new user
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "Test123@"
}

### Login to get JWT token
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "Test123@"
}

